Explicit references do not use heading fallback

```
# Plan

See [x][Plan] and [Plan][].
.
<section id="Plan">
  <h1>Plan</h1>
  <p>See [x][Plan] and <a href="#Plan">Plan</a>.</p>
</section>
```

```
# Plan

[Plan]: /defined

See [x][Missing], [x][Plan] and [Plan][].
.
<section id="Plan">
  <h1>Plan</h1>
  <p>See [x][Missing], <a href="/defined">x</a> and <a href="/defined">Plan</a>.</p>
</section>
```
